    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 11 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words \"twelve months and to a fine of not less than two hundred and fifty ringgit and not exceeding one thousand ringgit, and, in any other case, to imprisonment for six months and to a fine of five hundred ringgit\" the words \"a term not exceeding two years and to a fine of not less than one thousand ringgit and not more than five thousand ringgit, and, in any other case, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year and to a fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the proviso to subsection (2), by substituting for the words \"conviction or release from imprisonment, whichever shall be the later\" the words \"such conviction\". Amendment of section 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 12(6A) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words \"his address within the constituency for which he seeks election\" the words \"his correspondence address\". Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 14 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1) The election agent of a candidate shall at an election— (a) appoint every polling agent, counting agent, clerk and messenger employed, whether for payment or not, on behalf of the candidate; (b) hire every committee-room hired on behalf of the candidate; Bill (c) inform the presiding officer at each polling station in writing of the name and address of— (i) the polling agent or agents appointed to act at that station; and (ii) the counting agent or agents appointed to attend the counting of votes at that station; and (d) inform the returning officer of the constituency or electoral ward concerned in writing of the name and address of the counting agent or agents appointed to attend the counting of the votes of postal voters and the official addition of votes.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(!A) Every polling agent or counting agent of a candidate appointed under subsection (1) shall act or be present at the polling station or shall attend the counting of votes at the polling station for at least two hours and his replacement shall only be admitted to that polling station on the expiration of the two-hour period.\". Amendment of section ISA"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/7/eng@/~cl_13__para_a",
