      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: \"(a) of holding, convening or organising any open public meeting, open public rally, open public display or open public entertainment or giving open public address or lecture;\". Amendment of section 19"
